<deadlockability name="Puddle Punch" />

'''Puddle Punch''' materialises a giant fist that strikes everyone in a target area, dealing damage and slowing them.

== How to use it ==
* A long-range engage and disruption tool: open a fight, interrupt channels, or peel for a teammate from across a skirmish.
* Pairs naturally with '''[[Splatter]]''' — slowed targets are far easier to catch in the punch.
* Tier upgrades add a second charge and damage, then radius and lifesteal, and finally a big cooldown cut with heavy-melee damage.

See the full kit on the [[Abilities]] page.

